OL,3,GNEWSASearch for 'suspicious men' in dog
OL,4,Awalker's murder
OL,5,
OL,6,FDetectives investigating the murder of
OL,7,Fa man who was found dead in woodland
OL,8,Fwant to hear from anyone who saw "two
OL,9,Fmen acting suspiciously".
OL,11,FGraham Pennycook, 64, failed to return
OL,12,Fhome on 24 September after walking his
OL,13,Fdog. His body was found later that day
OL,14,Fin woods next to Perham Down polo field
OL,15,Fin Ludgershall, Wiltshire.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,350,340,200,160,0,100
